{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TgDjTaJhf8X1SbgnkLMobd","type":"tool_result","content":"15:#   written under reports/R7/ or this script fails — see GOAL 4.\n22:# reports/R1.3/accept.sh (GOAL 4): a COPY of the shipped gate source is patched\n33:# The same reasoning is why GOAL 2c exists. R1.3 closed with a residual ~4%\n64:head_ \"GOAL 1 — the daemon and the thin client exist at all\"\n100:head_ \"GOAL 2 — with the daemon up, the gate's median is under 1 ms (in-process)\"\n229:head_ \"GOAL 3 — with the daemon down, behaviour is byte-identical to today\"\n260:head_ \"GOAL 4 — the harness is named, exactly, with its commit\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cd1d3b8-0ab4-436c-a096-b92b12ed0757","uuid":"baf13e9e-5520-46a6-85e1-75785f58cdf6","timestamp":"2026-08-24T10:37:13.009Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"15:#   written under reports/R7/ or this script fails — see GOAL 4.\n22:# reports/R1.3/accept.sh (GOAL 4): a COPY of the shipped gate source is patched\n33:# The same reasoning is why GOAL 2c exists. R1.3 closed with a residual ~4%\n64:head_ \"GOAL 1 — the daemon and the thin client exist at all\"\n100:head_ \"GOAL 2 — with the daemon up, the gate's median is under 1 ms (in-process)\"\n229:head_ \"GOAL 3 — with the daemon down, behaviour is byte-identical to today\"\n260:head_ \"GOAL 4 — the harness is named, exactly, with its commit\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
